Source: pgzint
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libzint-dev (>= 2.14.0)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/davidbeauchamp/pgzint

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pgzint
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pgzint
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Zint barcode generation functions for PostgreSQL
 pgzint exposes the Zint barcode library to PostgreSQL and returns
 PNG-formatted barcodes for the symbologies supported by Zint.
